  "releaseNotes": "Ver 2.0.1\n      - Bug Fix\n          - Fixed an issue where an exception occurred when inputting a Jpeg image in the Document class.\n      Ver 2.0.0\n      - First Release\n      - The following APIs have been moved From [StarMicronics.CloudPRNT-Utility] package.\n          - ConversionOptions\n          - Document\n          - ICpDocument\n          - CutType, DeviceFont, DrawerOpenTime, HoldPrintControl, PaperPresentStatusControl\n          - ImageDoc, MarkupDoc, TextDoc\n      - Bug Fix\n          - Fixed a problem that could cause unintended printing results when an image containing transparency information is input.",
